      "text": [
        " اَلْأَرْضِ وَ اِبْتَغُوا مِنْ فَضْلِ اَللّٰهِ» فَقَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ «اَلصَّلاَةُ يَوْمَ اَلْجُمُعَةِ وَ اَلاِنْتِشَارُ يَوْمَ اَلسَّبْتِ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2397 - Abu Ayyub Al-Khazzaz and Abdullah ibn Sinan asked Abu Abdullah (as) about the saying of Allah (swt), the Exalted:\n\"So when the prayer has been concluded, disperse within the land and seek from the bounty of Allah (swt).\" (Surah Al-Jumu'ah 62:10)\nImam (as) said: \"The prayer refers to the day of Friday, and the dispersal refers to the day of Saturday.\""
        ]
      }
